    'body' => <<<'HTML'
<p>Property damage can disrupt a home or a business in an instant, and the insurance claim that follows should not add to the stress. For many Coastal Bend owners, it does. Policies are dense, adjusters rotate, coastal properties often carry two or three separate policies, and the first estimate frequently falls short of what repairs cost. Corpus Christi Public Adjuster provides insurance claim services in Corpus Christi for policyholders only: we handle the inspection, documentation, estimating, and communication with the insurer so you can focus on recovery.</p>
<p>The service cards above link to each claim type. Below is an overview of how those services fit together.</p>

